  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2017" />
  <History Date="13-06-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="23-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Terbly OV370Z-R" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Elation Platinum Wash ZXF Pro XL" />
  <History Date="28-08-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda K20" />
  <History Date="30-10-12" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Edited extended mode to include cell layout. Added RGBW master channels and added attribute links to RGBW cells" />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased 16-bit functions to 2dp.  Standardised shutted function order." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added detailed functions to Colour Macro and Function attributes." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed shape mode.  Added Extended RGBW mode." />
  <History Date="27-10-13" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda Wash K10" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="02-03-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added 'Full' mode and brought in line with latest spec." />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated Shape strobe, Back strobe and back select to latest spec." />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated shapes." />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added shape offset conditional functions for new shapes." />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised wheel mappings and attribute groups." />
  <History Date="08-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed lens rot CW spin range.  Changed lens rot spin display to value 1dp to provide full resolution." />
  <History Date="02-01-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated to 11.2014 spec" />
  <History Date="24-11-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed extended mapping" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="29-06-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Shape Control only mode and celled version of full Shapes mode." />
  <History Date="29-08-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised classic pearl refs" />
  <History Date="04-09-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="30-07-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Clay Paky A.leda B-EYE K10 (poor documentation)" />
  <History Date="05-08-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
